ull,"call_locator":"956f67303c1c3e5d8ee8e65c6ab15ea8301bc3586986e2f43a3c13bcb2446695","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"012e9be7a007d09c7f25670ce23bd07e7dc76fae3e0339e8fa183891beb629ab","logical_entry_identity":"970888b1f990ac0640175ae6d108985a57d86109920cfd1376946ee4bafdf813","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pest Control","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"害虫防治"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"465154a5b99f91d67f929a5ec91aa2601a5a1a1001c110f097e76901b9a465d1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0130a11b50969f44091fd8d64901542232b4e8891d76ccf5c8a37948827e98f1","logical_entry_identity":"1cac5496864c4cf93fbd3aedb16b0442539a224739a83f4d53452a8299da0ea2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#Could not generate a random object with filter: %s","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#无法使用以下筛选器生成随机物品：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4a2692f738621c3a9918272626f121ede8e3a6f3846063eb0e70f991d84348b5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"013415e26a1241a7d0c4163493510c7400d423db0c33ae51db8ea2d106092fe9","logical_entry_identity":"c9e9a8a9971a55f12c6be72fbdaadffff21f90d538b97aca7aa2989a515e52e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have 'extracted' the heart of one of your fellow necromancers.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你已经取得了你死灵法师同类的心脏。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3e212707b3183c3c296e447096128ba6f523625beba388012a17564523b46fdd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0134ef39e7ed606206998f32cf09882a5358af8494e53d5c1defe96a1030e20c","logical_entry_identity":"51ca636dd6cee658d707df647dce83bb2241817079891c79ae16227ea2a0f264","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"elvala guard","source_tag":"entity name","target":"埃尔瓦拉守卫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bba3e40ada48da834249f4fd1217debb9cd6613af29ee52c2d9b509375162d34","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"013d60070f9362f2e3c5fd1a6703166a0123ac30e633a3b90850ae80c50cb86f","logical_entry_identity":"43a72a0688b2c61412e2c252267c0ab22e666af8d2841dd2732f2b75677a73cb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Some men have said that the feet of halflings can nay be harmed, not by fire, blade nor magic. And they do say that this is a truly astounding thing. And some men consider the foot of a halfling to be an item of great luck and protection, and many have one hung above their door or mantle. Though these days 'tis frowned upon to go hunt for one, so 'tis considered a prized heirloom to be passed from father to son.\n\nBut women do look upon men and declare them fools. \"For how,\" say they, \"Can the foot of a halfling be a lucky thing, when with their large uncomely feet they are not able to wear shoes and footwear of elegant crafts and beauteous materials? And especially 'tis a great misfortune unto them, as with their short stature they could really do with a decent pair of heels...\"\n\nAnd lo, 'tis little mystery why halflings do look upon humans and say \"The Big Folk really are very dumb.\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"有人说半身人的脚不会受伤，火焰、刀剑和魔法都伤不了它。他们觉得此事着实惊人。\n于是一些人认为半身人的脚是一件拥有巨大幸运与守护之力的物品，许多人将它挂在门楣上方或壁炉架上。由于目前大家并不赞成为此捕杀半身人，所以稀有的脚常被视为贵重的传家宝传承下去。\n\n但女人们却经常一脸不屑地看着男人们，并直言他们的愚蠢：“这些半身人的脚怎么可能象征幸运？瞧他们那双难看的大脚，根本穿不了以精湛工艺和美丽材料制成的鞋履。尤其以他们矮小的身材，着实很需要一双像样的高跟鞋……”\n\n所以，半身人为何看着人类说“这些大个子真蠢”，也就不难理解了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bb2926ebd7b7dcb5dc83df5ffac4ec85569b04920bb87b02279aa5b2f9d145a7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"01409da2ad51b05fd76c36e8f247f3040bad805313b2502e64fafa271d986049","logical_entry_identity":"0824ccdd90e7a125091dfa248717ba6be2f230583cd6fa8b5ab6382aa1a806d8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Status","source_tag":"_t","target":"状态"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"941b74cfd60aef8e2aebfe22156216f78ab4b52980185242cb5a423d431d0a2a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0141337e6e82c5310d8628790ec1190ac2e427387be9a565213aac2cbe8e3bdf","logical_entry_identity":"ff9e20afcc453bf9a90b3a54e3a8ed79bdaadc8965be11972849ef5fdc443e14","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"myths of creation","source_tag":"newLore category","target":"创世神话"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"368e659562e40b794850bda23c5781cd1cdb3068c5f8b8841647b12e4e6734f7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"01454ac01f6729e60a51c8a0e340df6e89b547fe6d2993cc23bd8602a291d0dd","logical_entry_identity":"03b102650480b8ee9898c5e79637f0714f961cad43132637eb1060a1c944f170","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The air reeks with noxious fumes and the ground around it decays.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在它周围，毒雾散播，大地枯萎。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"94ac9051584dc6972cdac961b11a2e646c0095f8a6fd66fcac854be2ea4ad686","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0145e411f38b02cf53510f802b7e45607582c98830b59b4fa5c87f5299302825","logical_entry_identity":"7b69cf8f0687bf62f31af03bd3adda33268c94c67911ca0d8684afc2177d8400","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Well, I'll see if I can help.","source_tag":"_t","target":"好吧，我看看我能不能帮上忙。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fefd71846624b8fe5edbb63443a4e07f691f4a0006f708ec019ead2ddb0355bd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0145fb25831f48b3658df2af6046e847e0e4c983015dc375897bbd0a07781bdd","logical_entry_identity":"0172932df0d24487c4487d47a33fdad77f173de411cec350602ee4a790cdf5f1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Spellblaze Chronicles(3): The Farportal","source_tag":"_t","target":"魔法大爆炸纪事(3)：远行传送门"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d3cb5c405a03100b005df1252308e838c4740b44b2d2ffb50d73f5619f557e94","component":"engine","entry_revision_identity":"4145cfc5cb1327e5665c9cca1f16b5399f1305302060af4d3bb5081056499d94","logical_entry_identity":"78b04dc8ff35ff9a39f380086ef6ada9168c26bcdd475b34da5dda25b893b8c9","normalized_path":"engine.lua","source":"Oops! Either you activated safe mode manually or the game detected it did not start correctly last time and thus you are in #LIGHT_GREEN#safe mode#WHITE#.\nSafe Mode disabled all graphical options and sets a low FPS. It is not advisable to play this way (as it will be very painful and ugly).\n\nPlease go to the Video Options and try enabling/disabling options and then restarting until you do not get this message.\nA usual problem is shaders and thus should be your first target to disable.","source_tag":"_t","target":"糟糕！如果你不是手动开启了安全模式的话，那么说明，游戏检测到上一次启动时发生错误，目前游戏已进入#LIGHT_GREEN#安全模式#WHITE#。\n在安全模式下，所有图形选项都被关闭，FPS被设置为很低。不建议在这种情况下进行游戏(游戏画面会变得很难看)。\n\n请你进入游戏视频选项，尝试启用或禁用各项选项并重启游戏，直到不再弹出此消息。\n常见的问题一般是由着色器引发的，你可以先尝试关闭这些选项。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6655187fbdd4ae07146252725f2fdb02d2a8abd54b448b5f4a94535f2b345f64","component":"boot","entry_revision_identity":"489ba33fdcbbd9865e5af906657a8ffe994c8deb872e96c4e3da0f8a5a3c371c","logical_entry_identity":"1eca90d514a70360e07e8d57eaa3d9c35df41dd4a207864b554e51918b24c5d9","normalized_path":"mod-boot.lua","source":"Oops! Either you activated safe mode manually or the game detected it did not start correctly last time and thus you are in #LIGHT_GREEN#safe mode#WHITE#.\nSafe Mode disabled all graphical options and sets a low FPS. It is not advisable to play this way (as it will be very painful and ugly).\n\nPlease go to the Video Options and try enabling/disabling options and then restarting until you do not get this message.\nA usual problem is shaders and thus should be your first target to disable.","source_tag":"_t","target":"糟糕！如果你不是手动开启了安全模式的话，那么说明，游戏检测到上一次启动时发生错误，目前游戏已进入#LIGHT_GREEN#安全模式#WHITE#。\n在安全模式下，所有图形选项都被关闭，FPS被设置为很低。不建议在这种情况下进行游戏(游戏画面会变得很难看)。\n\n请你进入游戏视频选项，尝试启用或禁用各项选项并重启游戏，直到不再弹出此消息。\n常见的问题一般是由着色器引发的，你可以先尝试关闭这些选项。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}}